sequenceDiagram
    participant S as EngineCore scheduler
    participant R as Ascend V1 runner
    participant P as PLE input adapter
    participant D as Qwen4Exp decoder
    participant I as QSA indexer
    participant A as GBSA backend
    participant O as Sampler and output
    S->>R: Scheduled token rows and block tables
    R->>P: Request token history and query starts
    P-->>R: PLE context in stable buffers
    R->>D: Token IDs, positions, metadata, PLE context
    D->>I: QSA hidden row and position
    I->>I: Write raw key and completed compressed key
    I-->>D: Selected compressed group IDs
    D->>A: Write main K/V then read selected groups
    A-->>D: Sparse attention vector
    D-->>R: Final sampled hidden row
    R->>O: Logits and sampling metadata
    O-->>R: Sampled token IDs per request
    R-->>S: ModelRunnerOutput
